00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:45.530
 And, but that was something that either wasn't focused on in my classes that I had, I had no reason at the time to, to know that I had to have in-depth planting schedules with in-depth Excel sheet, you know, understanding calculations.

00:10:45.530 --> 00:11:08.640
 Everything that really made it, um, you know, just, uh, unique for you and would be very different for other people that were like, you know, reading that thesis or listening to this and potentially wanting to embark was that he had land to start out with, which was his family's land, which is, you know, one of the biggest obstacles for farmers just to get that piece of land.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:13.180
 And so he could kind of start experimenting rent-free and doing that.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:21.340
 So I think that's another reason why the, the money-making wasn't like at such the forefront and it was kind of like a part-time thing.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:26.060
 He was working other jobs and not necessarily trying to make that his entire career at that point.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:26.740
 Exactly.

